And white just has long-term massive pressure on f7,

01:00:17.400 --> 01:00:20.760
Black's position is super cramped, et cetera, et cetera,

01:00:20.760 --> 01:00:27.600
So if black plays queen to b6, once again, you can drive the knight up to c2, and now

