black no longer has bishop g5, and the plan here is just to push the f pawn all the way

01:00:33.560 --> 01:00:38.600
up to f5 and break down black's pawn chain and checkmate black on the king side,

01:00:38.600 --> 01:00:41.300
So this is my prep and a nutshell,

01:00:41.300 --> 01:00:44.200
This will win you a lot of games, so you're welcome,

