01:07:05.120 --> 01:07:12.560
It's these small subtleties, these move orders, and they are what start to decide the game

01:07:12.560 --> 01:07:13.560
at this level,

01:07:13.560 --> 01:07:18.320
It may sound totally insignificant, but I think after bishop b1, black is borderline

